---
// 图5：Agent 里的 System 1 / System 2 分层——Jev 高频把关，低置信度才升级 LLM
---

<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 640 320" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs><marker id="jev-st-arw" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z" fill="#94a3b8"/></marker></defs>
    <g font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif">
      <text x="320" y="24" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74" text-anchor="middle">Agent Harness：System 1 把关，System 2 兜底</text>

      {/* 观测 */}
      <rect x="220" y="44" width="200" height="38" rx="9" fill="#f2f8fa" stroke="#0085a1"/>
      <text x="320" y="68" font-size="11.5" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">观测 → 组装成符号化 state</text>
      <line x1="320" y1="82" x2="320" y2="100" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#jev-st-arw)"/>

      {/* Jev 层 */}
      <rect x="130" y="104" width="380" height="62" rx="10" fill="#e4f5ec" stroke="#0f9d68" stroke-width="1.6"/>
      <text x="320" y="129" font-size="12" font-weight="bold" fill="#0a7a50" text-anchor="middle">Jev（System 1）：动作选择 / 路由 / 测试闸门 / 死循环阻断</text>
      <text x="320" y="150" font-size="10.5" fill="#0a7a50" text-anchor="middle">单次前向、百毫秒级 · 每次返回答案 + 校准概率与 confidence</text>

      {/* 分支 */}
      <line x1="320" y1="166" x2="320" y2="186" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <line x1="150" y1="186" x2="490" y2="186" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5"/>
      <line x1="150" y1="186" x2="150" y2="204" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#jev-st-arw)"/>
      <line x1="490" y1="186" x2="490" y2="204" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#jev-st-arw)"/>

      {/* 左：高置信 */}
      <rect x="40" y="206" width="220" height="68" rx="10" fill="#f2f8fa" stroke="#0085a1"/>
      <text x="150" y="230" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74" text-anchor="middle">置信度 ≥ 业务标定阈值</text>
      <text x="150" y="249" font-size="10.5" fill="#334155" text-anchor="middle">直接执行确定性工具调用</text>
      <text x="150" y="266" font-size="9.5" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">阈值为示例，需按业务数据标定</text>

      {/* 右：低置信升级 */}
      <rect x="380" y="206" width="220" height="68" rx="10" fill="#fdf0e0" stroke="#e6a23c"/>
      <text x="490" y="230" font-size="11.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#b97a1f" text-anchor="middle">置信度不足 → 升级 System 2</text>
      <text x="490" y="249" font-size="10.5" fill="#b97a1f" text-anchor="middle">前沿 LLM 推理、给理由、处理未见局面</text>

      {/* 回路 */}
      <path d="M490 274 L490 298 L320 298" fill="none" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>
      <text x="386" y="290" font-size="10" fill="#64748b" text-anchor="middle">LLM 结论与新观测写回 state，进入下一轮</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
